Key passes: Passo Gardena (2,121 m), Passo Sella (2,218 m), Passo Pordoi (2,239 m), Passo Campolongo (1,875 m)
Best for: Dolomite scenery, multi-pass loops, intermediate to advanced riders
Best time: June to September
